<title>UK: Vanguard Medica says migraine drug effective.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Medica says migraine drug effective.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Vanguard Medica Plc said on Monday full results from its Phase IIB trial of VML 251 showed that the anti-migraine drug had a very low rate of recurrence of headaches.</p>
</text>
